{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-10-92","kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：截差无理线段与中项无理线段与比例","englishTitle":"If an area be contained by a rational straight line and a second apotome, the side of the area is a first apotome of a medial straight line.","book":10,"number":92,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.92","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.92/","group":"prop_3","sourceNumber":92,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-10-92@raw-43312e937c1460b9","contentId":"euclid-10-92","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"43312e937c1460b93cff6427e103fcf708bc5f2dc24ff9c228852b83f3070a94","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-10-92.statement","euclid-10-92.construction.1","euclid-10-92.construction.2","euclid-10-92.proof.1","euclid-10-92.construction.3","euclid-10-92.proof.2","euclid-10-92.proof.3","euclid-10-92.proof.4","euclid-10-92.proof.5","euclid-10-92.proof.6","euclid-10-92.construction.4","euclid-10-92.construction.5","euclid-10-92.proof.7","euclid-10-92.proof.8","euclid-10-92.proof.9","euclid-10-92.proof.10","euclid-10-92.proof.11","euclid-10-92.proof.12","euclid-10-92.proof.13","euclid-10-92.proof.14","euclid-10-92.proof.15","euclid-10-92.proof.16","euclid-10-92.proof.17","euclid-10-92.proof.18","euclid-10-92.conclusion","euclid-10-92.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-10-92.statement","contentId":"euclid-10-92","revisionId":"euclid-10-92@raw-43312e937c1460b9","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4e762113defec0fd17cb64b72385c6bf3eae382f87746588c205421059c875eb","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If an area be contained by a rational straight line and a second apotome, the side of the area is a first apotome of a medial straight line."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果一个区域由有理线段和第二个截差无理线段组成,则该区域的一侧是中项无理线段区的第一个截差无理线段。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-92.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-10-92","revisionId":"euclid-10-92@raw-43312e937c1460b9","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"cf90da49ccd78e86b75b8580f8a51e535d3ecef46928b8f98a96fc87d9f69d44","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let the area AB be contained by the rational straight line AC and the second apotome AD; I say that the side of the area AB is a first apotome of a medial straight line."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让我们把AB区分为有理线段 AC和截差无理线段 AD;我说,AB区是中项无理线段区中的第一个截差无理线段。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-92.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-10-92","revisionId":"euclid-10-92@raw-43312e937c1460b9","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ce6b656e2fcf76d6a024163146a2c51cdd86a73b19bb5527885744b5bbe4dfce","citations":["euclid-10-73","euclid-10-def-12"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let DG be the annex to AD; therefore AG, GD are rational straight lines commensurable in square only, [[X. 73](/principles/euclid-10-73)] and the annex DG is commensurable with the rational straight line AC set out, while the square on the whole AG is greater than the square on the annex GD by the square on a straight line commensurable in length with AG. [[X. Deff. III. 2](/principles/euclid-10-def-12)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"DG是AD的附件;因此,AG,GD是有理线段 平方可公度而长度不可公度,附件DG是可公度,有理线段 AC是GD,而正方形是AG,比附件GD的正方形大,直线长度可公度和AG是正方形。 [[X. 73](/principles/euclid-10-73)] [[X. Deff. III. 2](/principles/euclid-10-def-12)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-92.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-10-92","revisionId":"euclid-10-92@raw-43312e937c1460b9","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5ca90c726fa2f40cb35fae15c862aa0c063e46845bcd4aea052355e290db4f22","citations":["euclid-10-17"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Since then the square on AG is greater than the square on GD by the square on a straight line commensurable with AG, therefore, if there be applied to AG a parallelogram equal to the fourth part of the square on GD and deficient by a square figure, it divides it into commensurable parts. [[X. 17](/principles/euclid-10-17)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,如果对AG a 平行四边形的直线适用等于正方形的第四部分,而该数字又不足正方形,则分为可公度部分。（相关点与线段：GD） [[X. 17](/principles/euclid-10-17)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-92.construction.3","contentId":"euclid-10-92","revisionId":"euclid-10-92@raw-43312e937c1460b9","order":4,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"680c6e3286fc18895809127d97a6dec0ce56e2a7a6c27869e42d92d4f2975b93","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let then DG be bisected at E, let there be applied to AG a parallelogram equal to the square on EG and deficient by a square figure, and let it be the rectangle AF, FG; therefore AF is commensurable in length with FG."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"DG分,E分两部分AG a 平行四边形 等于 正方形 EG 等于 EG 等于 不足 正方形 数值并让它成为矩形 AF FG;因此,AF是长度可公度和FG。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-92.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-10-92","revisionId":"euclid-10-92@raw-43312e937c1460b9","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"93bfc127b4ff539ee74f6e647a28c827c7529453ac1f79e3e3c1b548af5dd406","citations":["euclid-10-15"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore AG is also commensurable in length with each of the straight lines AF, FG. [[X. 15](/principles/euclid-10-15)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,AG直线为长度可公度,每条直线为AF,FG。 [[X. 15](/principles/euclid-10-15)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-92.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-10-92","revisionId":"euclid-10-92@raw-43312e937c1460b9","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c1d1504804442dbf99e6ad9e2cfa14993a5b44e6a2cfa89a4d23c08461cc7c46","citations":["euclid-10-13","euclid-10-21"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But AG is rational and incommensurable in length with AC; therefore each of the straight lines AF, FG is also rational and incommensurable in length with AC; [[X. 13](/principles/euclid-10-13)] therefore each of the rectangles AI, FK is medial. [[X. 21](/principles/euclid-10-21)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但AG线长为有理,不可公度长为AC;因此,AF直线的每条长为AF,FG长为有理,不可公度长为AC;因此,矩形直线的每条长为中项无理线段,FK长为中项无理线段。（相关点与线段：AI） [[X. 13](/principles/euclid-10-13)] [[X. 21](/principles/euclid-10-21)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-92.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-10-92","revisionId":"euclid-10-92@raw-43312e937c1460b9","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"bb66bf41343fa8429674c84701253de8fe6d434910453800a660d33fdf38877b","citations":["euclid-10-15"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Again, since DE is commensurable with EG, therefore DG is also commensurable with each of the straight lines DE, EG. [[X. 15](/principles/euclid-10-15)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,由于DE是可公度,EG,因此DG也是可公度,每条直线DE,EG。 [[X. 15](/principles/euclid-10-15)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-92.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-10-92","revisionId":"euclid-10-92@raw-43312e937c1460b9","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f77cd67e28f02fbdfdd98933f6737024ca1300cbbc90676a3d5f59cb992a6d80","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But DG is commensurable in length with AC."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但DG是长度可公度和AC。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-92.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-10-92","revisionId":"euclid-10-92@raw-43312e937c1460b9","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"31b396b2cbbd9b288cc413e9adb937e1a22bbce7973b3c56ab545267cbaaefc9","citations":["euclid-10-19"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore each of the rectangles DH, EK is rational. [[X. 19](/principles/euclid-10-19)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,矩形 DH,EK每号都是有理。 [[X. 19](/principles/euclid-10-19)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-92.construction.4","contentId":"euclid-10-92","revisionId":"euclid-10-92@raw-43312e937c1460b9","order":10,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"babfa7d18a8f34adb9c1c723b99ec40f3b53bdc0752260d5e086c2e250ee19b1","citations":["euclid-6-26"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let then the square LM be constructed equal to AI, and let there be subtracted NO equal to FK and being about the same angle with LM, namely the angle LPM; therefore the squares LM, NO are about the same diameter. [[VI. 26](/principles/euclid-6-26)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"然后再将正方形 LM的构造等于AI,再减去NO的FK,其角度与LM的相同,即LPM角;因此,正方形 LM,NO的直径大致相同。 [[VI. 26](/principles/euclid-6-26)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-92.construction.5","contentId":"euclid-10-92","revisionId":"euclid-10-92@raw-43312e937c1460b9","order":11,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"72802f1b081a1ac963339b24e8028c256c6eb4278fd7cbc008025d669220eb2f","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let PR be their diameter, and let the figure be drawn."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让PR是直径, 让图绘制。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-92.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-10-92","revisionId":"euclid-10-92@raw-43312e937c1460b9","order":12,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ee913bc7ec6818cf7f9b5463830e160b6a7bc37fef2f1b8f1788c9c16e405708","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Since then AI, FK are medial and are equal to the squares on LP, PN, the squares on LP, PN are also medial; therefore LP, PN are also medial straight lines commensurable in square only."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"自那以后,FK为中项无理线段,相当于LP,PN为正方形,LP为正方形,PN为中项无理线段,LP为PN,PN为中项无理线段。（相关点与线段：AI）；上述对应量可公度。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-92.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-10-92","revisionId":"euclid-10-92@raw-43312e937c1460b9","order":13,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c315c13eb62c1570205b25bf5ceaa67afba04661f281c647cfbc1db8e8742bbd","citations":["euclid-6-17","euclid-6-1","euclid-5-11"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since the rectangle AF, FG is equal to the square on EG, therefore, as AF is to EG, so is EG to FG, [[VI. 17](/principles/euclid-6-17)] while, as AF is to EG, so is AI to EK, and, as EG is to FG, so is EK to FK; [[VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1)] therefore EK is a mean proportional between AI, FK. [[V. 11](/principles/euclid-5-11)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由于矩形 AF,FG等于EG,AF比EG,AF比FG,EG比EG,AF比AI比EK,EG比EK,EG比AI比EK,FG比EK,FK比EK,EK比比例中项；AF 与 EG 之比等于 EG 与 FG 之比；AF 与 EG 之比等于 AI 与 EK 之比；EG 与 FG 之比等于 EK 与 FK 之比。 [[VI. 17](/principles/euclid-6-17)] [[VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1)] [[V. 11](/principles/euclid-5-11)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-92.proof.9","contentId":"euclid-10-92","revisionId":"euclid-10-92@raw-43312e937c1460b9","order":14,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 9","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"383536f0827770cbfb383e0ecdf88cf006e5872e6421b3dc8926f3ad3fdcbf5b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But MN is also a mean proportional between the squares LM, NO, and AI is equal to LM, and FK to NO; therefore MN is also equal to EK."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但MN也是正方形,LM,NO,AI等于LM,FK等于NO,MN等于EK。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-92.proof.10","contentId":"euclid-10-92","revisionId":"euclid-10-92@raw-43312e937c1460b9","order":15,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 10","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"cd65d0a319f83d34a1262adef8617056321a57d164197c7ae100ad567510cd85","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But DH is equal to EK, and LO equal to MN; therefore the whole DK is equal to the gnomon UVW and NO."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但DH等于EK,LO等于MN;因此,整个DK等于曲尺形 UVW和NO。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-92.proof.11","contentId":"euclid-10-92","revisionId":"euclid-10-92@raw-43312e937c1460b9","order":16,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 11","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"dcdd44e3a6609fb6bd287e1a630ff1e8d2755aeb282ecf2f0a811563a4a8445b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Since then the whole AK is equal to LM, NO, and, in these, DK is equal to the gnomon UVW and NO, therefore the remainder AB is equal to TS."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"自那时以来,整个AK案件相当于LM,NO案件,其中DK案件相当于曲尺形,UVW和NO案件,因此其余AB案件等于TS案件。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-92.proof.12","contentId":"euclid-10-92","revisionId":"euclid-10-92@raw-43312e937c1460b9","order":17,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 12","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d3594a7a0f7bc5eb73b111655af11e7e7a83889fc289ffa82ae07bdd13175fbc","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But TS is the square on LN; therefore the square on LN is equal to the area AB; therefore LN is the side of the area AB."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但TS是LN的正方形,LN的正方形等于AB的区域,LN是AB区域的一侧。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-92.proof.13","contentId":"euclid-10-92","revisionId":"euclid-10-92@raw-43312e937c1460b9","order":18,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 13","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ea546c4ca7f2f32ce4207d427b63418ba09b99510ff98434b6d1c4f433a7f0fc","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"I say that LN is a first apotome of a medial straight line."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"我说LN是中项无理线段的截差无理线段头一击"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-92.proof.14","contentId":"euclid-10-92","revisionId":"euclid-10-92@raw-43312e937c1460b9","order":19,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 14","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"acb9c3723022cdeea54953c332fbd8f9a0f8449db08bf9ed79e41dd92cc67301","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, since EK is rational and is equal to LO, therefore LO, that is, the rectangle LP, PN, is rational."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因为EK是有理,等于LO,因此LO,也就是说,矩形 LP,PN是有理。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-92.proof.15","contentId":"euclid-10-92","revisionId":"euclid-10-92@raw-43312e937c1460b9","order":20,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 15","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e40b3d519e62b498ce75cc6c2d3a4b97195bc77940839a944a6b7b563dced5ef","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But NO was proved medial; therefore LO is incommensurable with NO."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但NO被证明为中项无理线段,因此LO被证明为不可公度,NO被证明为NO。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-92.proof.16","contentId":"euclid-10-92","revisionId":"euclid-10-92@raw-43312e937c1460b9","order":21,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 16","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"30c4fd58acb6abaa68826e45daaa2d401cba307448bc2eb3b51b88444ae3aafa","citations":["euclid-6-1","euclid-10-11"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, as LO is to NO, so is LP to PN; [[VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1)] therefore LP, PN are incommensurable in length. [[X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,LO比NO的比等于LP比PN,因此,LP比PN等于不可公度；LO 与 NO 之比等于 LP 与 PN 之比。 [[VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1)] [[X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-92.proof.17","contentId":"euclid-10-92","revisionId":"euclid-10-92@raw-43312e937c1460b9","order":22,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 17","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d901652984c6c2edebc8230dc7ca74483893d762a59ea4c559dfa0e48dfc1483","citations":["euclid-10-74"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore LP, PN are medial straight lines commensurable in square only which contain a rational rectangle; therefore LN is a first apotome of a medial straight line. [[X. 74](/principles/euclid-10-74)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,LP,PN是中项无理线段,平方可公度而长度不可公度,包含有理,矩形;因此,LN是中项无理线段,截差无理线段的第一个截差无理线段。 [[X. 74](/principles/euclid-10-74)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-92.proof.18","contentId":"euclid-10-92","revisionId":"euclid-10-92@raw-43312e937c1460b9","order":23,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 18","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d974a98ce884471c981547f3e8307b6504280c4c21d2024ff7c18ceac8e97388","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And it is the side of the area AB."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"并且是AB区的另一边"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-92.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-10-92","revisionId":"euclid-10-92@raw-43312e937c1460b9","order":24,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"000fa72d47fff85ea9c6865bf849680f09ffe2c7fa591227dfa814772d05b8ee","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the side of the area AB is a first apotome of a medial straight line. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,AB区一侧是中项无理线段.Q.E区中的第一个截差无理线段区。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-92.source","contentId":"euclid-10-92","revisionId":"euclid-10-92@raw-43312e937c1460b9","order":25,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b2cf0575812443c06bb86b4da60e2d05d8fdf602d648eb5749c78090dc894430",